## 11.5 典型问题
### TopK问题
```java
// 静态TopK - 排序 O(nlogn)
public List<Integer> topK1(int[] arr, int k) {
    Arrays.sort(arr);
    return Arrays.stream(arr).boxed()
        .skip(arr.length - k).collect(Collectors.toList());
}

// 动态TopK - 堆 O(nlogk)
public List<Integer> topK2(int[] arr, int k) {
    PriorityQueue<Integer> minHeap = new PriorityQueue<>();
    for (int num : arr) {
        if (minHeap.size() < k) minHeap.offer(num);
        else if (num > minHeap.peek()) {
            minHeap.poll();
            minHeap.offer(num);
        }
    }
    return new ArrayList<>(minHeap);
}
```### 流中中位数
```java
class MedianFinder {
    private PriorityQueue<Integer> maxHeap; // 大顶堆，存较小的一半
    private PriorityQueue<Integer> minHeap; // 小顶堆，存较大的一半

    public MedianFinder() {
        maxHeap = new PriorityQueue<>(Collections.reverseOrder());
        minHeap = new PriorityQueue<>();
    }

    public void addNum(int num) {
        maxHeap.offer(num);
        minHeap.offer(maxHeap.poll());
        if (maxHeap.size() < minHeap.size()) {
            maxHeap.offer(minHeap.poll());
        }
    }

    public double findMedian() {
        return maxHeap.size() > minHeap.size()
            ? maxHeap.peek()
            : (maxHeap.peek() + minHeap.peek()) / 2.0;
    }
}
```## 11.6 本章小结
- 堆是完全二叉树，通过数组高效存储
- 插入删除都是O(log n)，获取最值O(1)
- PriorityQueue是Java的标准实现
- 适合TopK、中位数、优先级调度等场景